IDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BhaalTemple_MashasWeddingVows</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BhaalTemple_MashasWeddingVows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BhaalTemple_MashasWeddingVows\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9d5e056c-ee18-4489-94dc-a33d1bc7f228</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9d5e056c-ee18-4489-94dc-a33d1bc7f228\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9d5e056c-ee18-4489-94dc-a33d1bc7f228\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by a skeleton in <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;15&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1014</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Stiv%27s_Wedding_Vows\" title=\"Stiv's Wedding Vows\">Stiv</a>, when I called you to elope, I meant for us to be together eternally, in the only way my faith allows. This dagger, the sacred mark of my Lord, is our witness, priest and officiant. With it, I die by your side, and you by mine. Offer up your belly of flesh, that I may rend it.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stiv%27s_Wedding_Vows\" title=\"Stiv's Wedding Vows\">Stiv's Wedding Vows</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715002025\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1362/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23959/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5776/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931443/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.623      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.623      1 -total\n 48.34%   21.570      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.19%   19.274     15 Template:Trim\n 24.17%   10.787      2 Template:Uid\n 19.98%    8.914      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.28%    6.371      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.73%    4.341      1 Template:Notes\n  9.37%    4.183      6 Template:Ifempty\n  8.96%    3.999      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46820-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715002025 and revision id 243638. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}